+- Stubbed `tr` fails all three `tr` calls in the function body.
+- `_cc_count` pipeline produces no output (stub tr prints nothing) → `_cc_count=""`.
+- The `case ''|*[!0-9]*)` guard fires → `die` is called with `'$_cc_safe_hname'`.
