++  # RED: current code uses `command -v gh` which accepts the fake gh in FAKE_BIN
++  # (an untrusted /tmp path) → emits "copilot-cli".
++  # GREEN: fixed code resolves gh's path and validates it against /usr/*, /opt/*,
